     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "A database is an **organized collection of data stored electronically** that allows efficient access, management, and updating of information.  \n",
      "\n",
      "*(Simplest version: A database is a structured system for storing and quickly finding data.)*\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "response = llm.invoke(\"What is a database? Explain in one simple sentence.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(response.content)"
   ]
